  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Visits the header of the class.",
      "translation": "访问类的头部。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from class: <code><a href=\"../../asm/ClassVisitor.html#visit(int,int,java.lang.String,java.lang.String,java.lang.String,java.lang.String%5B%5D)\">ClassVisitor</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从类复制：<code><a href=\"../../asm/ClassVisitor.html#visit(int,int,java.lang.String,java.lang.String,java.lang.String,java.lang.String%5B%5D)\">ClassVisitor</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>access</code> - the class's access flags (see <a href=\"../../asm/Opcodes.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.asm\"><code>Opcodes</code></a>). This parameter also indicates if\n    the class is deprecated <a href=\"../../asm/Opcodes.html#ACC_DEPRECATED\"><code>Opcodes.ACC_DEPRECATED</code></a> or a record <a href=\"../../asm/Opcodes.html#ACC_RECORD\"><code>Opcodes.ACC_RECORD</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>access</code> - 类的访问标志（参见<a href=\"../../asm/Opcodes.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.asm\"><code>Opcodes</code></a>）。此参数还指示类是否已弃用 <a href=\"../../asm/Opcodes.html#ACC_DEPRECATED\"><code>Opcodes.ACC_DEPRECATED</code></a> 或为记录 <a href=\"../../asm/Opcodes.html#ACC_RECORD\"><code>Opcodes.ACC_RECORD</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>superName</code> - the internal of name of the super class (see <a href=\"../../asm/Type.html#getInternalName()\"><code>Type.getInternalName()</code></a>).\n    For interfaces, the super class is <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Object</code></a>. May be null, but only for the\n    <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Object</code></a> class.",
      "translation": "<code>superName</code> - 父类的内部名称（参见 <a href=\"../../asm/Type.html#getInternalName()\"><code>Type.getInternalName()</code></a>）。对于接口，父类是 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Object</code></a>。可能为 null，但仅针对 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Object</code></a> 类。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../asm/ClassVisitor.html#visit(int,int,java.lang.String,java.lang.String,java.lang.String,java.lang.String%5B%5D)\">visit</a></code> in class <code><a href=\"../../asm/ClassVisitor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.asm\">ClassVisitor</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../../asm/ClassVisitor.html#visit(int,int,java.lang.String,java.lang.String,java.lang.String,java.lang.String%5B%5D)\">visit</a></code>` 类中的 `<code><a href=\"../../asm/ClassVisitor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.asm\">ClassVisitor</a></code>`",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>name</code> - the internal name of the class (see <a href=\"../../asm/Type.html#getInternalName()\"><code>Type.getInternalName()</code></a>).",
      "translation": "<code>name</code> - 类的内部名称（参见<a href=\"../../asm/Type.html#getInternalName()\"><code>Type.getInternalName()</code></a>）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>interfaces</code> - the internal names of the class's interfaces (see <a href=\"../../asm/Type.html#getInternalName()\"><code>Type.getInternalName()</code></a>). May be null.",
      "translation": "`interfaces` - 该类的内部接口名称（参见<a href=\"../../asm/Type.html#getInternalName()\"><code>Type.getInternalName()</code></a>）。可能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>version</code> - the class version. The minor version is stored in the 16 most significant bits,\n    and the major version in the 16 least significant bits.",
      "translation": "<code>version</code> - 类版本。小版本号存储在 16 个最高有效位中，大版本号存储在 16 个最低有效位中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>signature</code> - the signature of this class. May be null if the class is not a\n    generic one, and does not extend or implement generic classes or interfaces.",
      "translation": "<code>signature</code> - 此类的签名。如果该类不是泛型类，且不继承或实现泛型类或接口，则可能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Field Details",
      "translation": "字段详情",
      "count": 1
    }
  ]
}